{
  "info": {
    "name": "Geocoding.info API",
    "description": "# Geocoding.info API\n\nForward and reverse geocoding, OpenStreetMap object lookup, service status, and account usage.\n\n## Start here\n1. Create an account at https://geocoding.info/Signup.aspx and verify your email if required.\n2. Create an API key in your dashboard.\n3. Fork this collection into your own workspace and set `api_key` as a local secret. The shared value is intentionally empty; never publish a real key.\n4. Send Service status first, then try the geocoding examples. Send requests one at a time and respect your plan's rate limits.\n\nBase URL: https://api.geocoding.info\n\nPlans: https://geocoding.info/Pricing.aspx\nGuide: https://geocoding.info/Geocoding.aspx\nSupport: https://geocoding.info/Contact.aspx\n\nJSON and XML are supported for geocoding endpoints. English is the default unless `accept-language` is explicitly supplied. Search/lookup return lists; reverse geocoding returns an object. Results depend on OpenStreetMap coverage and are not postal-address validation. Keep API keys on your server and out of logs, repositories, screenshots and shared collection values.\n\nDaily and 30-day limits both apply. Refer to the live pricing page for current terms. The collection contains no private credentials and does not create accounts or purchase subscriptions.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.geocoding.info",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (pm.info.requestName !== \"Service status\" && !pm.variables.get(\"api_key\")) {",
          "  throw new Error(\"Fork this collection and set api_key locally. Never share a real key.\");",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Service status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "status"
          ],
          "query": []
        },
        "description": "Public health check; no API key required."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Search an address — JSON",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/search?q=Paris, France&format=json&accept-language=en&key={{api_key}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "search"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "q",
              "value": "Paris, France"
            },
            {
              "key": "format",
              "value": "json"
            },
            {
              "key": "accept-language",
              "value": "en"
            },
            {
              "key": "key",
              "value": "{{api_key}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Convert an address or place name into candidate coordinates."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
